        "source_note": "The source pools every deposited high-temperature P21mn epsilon-FeOOH observation in a BM2 analysis, assumes K0-prime=4, and obtains V0 separately by G-versus-g extrapolation. Its prose reports no resolvable epsilon thermal trend and no explicit correction formula; applying its own alpha0 to reduce the hot volumes to 300 K is the numerical step that recovers K0=158 GPa.",
        "audit": "../audits/e_feooh.audit.json#e_feooh_gleason_2008_bm2_1"
