        "source_note": "The source reports a conventional-cell BM3 high-temperature EOS for low-pressure InOOH-type epsilon-FeOOH. It fixes V0,300, fits five elastic/thermal coefficients, and defines alpha0 at T0 through alpha(T)=a0+a1(T-T0).",
        "audit": "../audits/e_feooh.audit.json#e_feooh_suzuki_2016_bm3_thermal_2"
      },
      "model": "BM3",
      "temperature_ref": 300.0,
