      "determination_method": "experimental",
      "record_kind": "published",
      "notes": "High-temperature BM3 for InOOH-type epsilon-FeOOH, far below the spin transition near 53 GPa discussed by Gleason et al. (2013); not the hydrogen-centered low-spin Pnnm phase.",
